    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Designation Force",
    "summary": "Friendly SCOUT SENTINEL or ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY SMOKE units gain Signal Flares, which lets such a unit, during your Shooting phase, pick an enemy unit that is visible to it and within 12″; the chosen unit becomes designated, and a designated unit gets +3″ to its detection range. This detachment carries the RECON tag, so it cannot be taken together with another RECON detachment.",
